      autonomy_need: [64, 0.52, "s", "N"],
      // [src_messi_footballespana_paycut, src_messi_goal_burofax, src_messi_aljazeera_2020, src_messi_footballespana_2021, src_messi_espn_oral | 2020-2022 | news reports + self-interview + teammate account] He publicly criticised people inside Barcelona in the March 2020 statement, challenged a club official over public criticism of players (reported by Goal), and in September 2020 called club management a disaster, yet declined to take the club to court and, at his 2021 farewell, said 'I can't speak for the club' rather than argue the La Liga dispute. Di Maria describes him as someone who 'keeps things bottled up' and then expresses it in an interview or on the pitch. A selective, indirect confrontation style rather than a clear high or low, so the score stays near the middle.
